    "title": "Fourth year of local campaign to feed young people doubles its reach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lauren Gallup ,\n1 days ago On a sunny, late August afternoon, there are a lot of families with little kids sitting in the dining room in Cooper’s Food & Drink in Tacoma, finishing lunch. It’s a scene that played out all summer. Cooper’s was among 18 restaurants where kids in Tacoma, Seattle and even Denver, Colorado, could come and get a free meal. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
